      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It’s a loose, silky\nsand that boosts the power of Ground-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "さわると　サラサラする　砂。\n持たせると　じめんタイプの\n技の　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "手感细腻的沙子。\n携带后，地面属性的\n招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Debe llevarla un Pokémon. La suavidad de la arena\nfortalece los movimientos de tipo Tierra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
